---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Hinton Studios — India's AI Filmmaking Pioneer | Founded by Abhinav Sanyal" 
  description="Founded by Abhinav Sanyal, ex-CTO & filmmaker. Hinton Studios is Bengaluru's premier AI film production house, pioneering generative AI filmmaking, AI spec ads & AI content creation."
  keywords="hinton studios, abhinav sanyal filmmaker, ai filmmaking studio india, ai film production company bengaluru, generative ai filmmaker, ai filmmaking pioneer, ai video production india"
>
  <main class="pt-32 pb-24">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <header class="px-6 md:px-12 mb-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto relative" data-reveal>
      <div class="monitor-bracket corner-tl"></div>
      <div class="monitor-bracket corner-tr"></div>
      <div class="monitor-bracket corner-bl"></div>
      <div class="monitor-bracket corner-br"></div>
      <div class="p-8 md:p-16 border border-outline-variant/10 bg-surface-container-low/50 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="absolute -right-40 -top-40 w-96 h-96 bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>
        <span class="font-label text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-tertiary mb-6 block font-bold">OPERATOR // 001</span>
        <h1 class="font-headline text-5xl md:text-8xl font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase leading-[0.85] text-on-surface mb-8">
          Abhinav Sanyal<br />
          <span class="text-primary italic font-light">Filmmaker. Engineer. Auteur.</span>
        </h1>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-outline font-label text-[9px] md:text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">
          <span class="border border-outline-variant/30 px-3 py-1 bg-black/40">Status: Active</span>
          <span class="border border-outline-variant/30 px-3 py-1 bg-black/40">Location: Bengaluru, India</span>
          <span class="border border-outline-variant/30 px-3 py-1 bg-black/40">Global Delivery: True</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="px-6 md:px-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-16 md:gap-24 mb-32">
      <!-- PORTRAIT / IMAGE AREA -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <div class="relative aspect-[3/4] cinematic-grade-teal overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container shadow-2xl">
          <!-- Placeholder for photo -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-surface to-surface-container-high/20 opacity-80 z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div class="w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center text-outline-variant uppercase font-label tracking-widest text-[10px]">
            [ FOUNDER_PORTRAIT.JPG ]
          </div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 z-20 viewfinder-corner">
            <span class="font-label text-[8px] tracking-[0.4em] text-primary uppercase">INTEL_GATHERING</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- STORY -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
        <span class="font-label text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-tertiary mb-6 block">Origin Code</span>
        <div class="space-y-6 font-body text-base md:text-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            For a decade, I engineered complex systems. Deep in the trenches of software engineering, most recently as CTO of Narrative (YC S23), I built AI agents that automated web UI testing 100%. I know how to push machines to their computational bounds.
          </p>
          <p>
            But systems don't feel. Stories do. 
          </p>
          <p>
            My heart repeatedly called me toward narrative, toward the visceral impact of cinema. Hinton Studios is the culmination of that calling. By blending my engineering precision with a deep reverence for traditional filmmaking, I founded a production house in Bengaluru where the art of storytelling is supercharged by generative AI.
          </p>
          <p class="text-white border-l-2 border-tertiary/40 pl-6 mt-8 italic text-xl leading-relaxed">
            "We are not waiting for the future of cinema. We are computing it."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THESIS -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 mb-32" data-reveal>
      <div class="bg-black border border-outline-variant/10 p-8 md:p-16 relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom_right,rgba(144,147,255,0.1),transparent_50%)] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-1000"></div>
        <span class="font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-outline font-bold mb-8 block">The Studio Thesis</span>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter text-white mb-8 leading-tight">
          Why human-led direction matters in the age of generative AI.
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-outline leading-relaxed max-w-3xl text-lg">
          Generative AI is a profound execution engine, but it lacks soul, intuition, and lived experience. Everyone now has access to the tools, but few possess the architectural vision to build films that resonate. At Hinton Studios, we lead with profound human intellect—crafting the script, the emotion, the pacing—while unleashing AI to execute the impossible. It’s an auteur’s vision realized at algorithmic speed.
        </p>
        
        <div class="mt-16 border-t border-white/5 pt-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
           <div>
             <span class="block font-headline text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">10+</span>
             <span class="font-label text-[10px] tracking-widest text-outline uppercase">Years Engineering</span>
           </div>
           <div>
             <span class="block font-headline text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">100%</span>
             <span class="font-label text-[10px] tracking-widest text-outline uppercase">Gen-AI Production</span>
           </div>
           <div>
             <span class="block font-headline text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">∞</span>
             <span class="font-label text-[10px] tracking-widest text-outline uppercase">Creative Range</span>
           </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="px-6 md:px-12 text-center" data-reveal>
      <a href="/services#contact" class="group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-12 py-6 md:px-24 md:py-8 border-2 border-primary/20 hover:border-primary transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-highest">
        <span class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out"></span>
        <span class="relative font-headline font-bold text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-tighter uppercase text-white group-hover:text-black flex items-center gap-4 transition-colors duration-500">
          Initiate Phase One
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform duration-500">arrow_right_alt</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
